{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5", "id": "msg_011Cg1zg3iHc16wQbQ3TKaVk", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "<message to=\"discord-main\">\n**Q3 Platform Review \u2014 five-point summary**\n\n1. **Availability missed target.** 99.82% uptime vs. a 99.9% goal, driven by two incidents: a 41-minute database failover (12 Aug) and a 22-minute CDN misconfiguration (3 Sep).\n\n2. **Infrastructure spend ran 6% over budget.** $418K against $394K, with the overage concentrated in egress charges.\n\n3. **Adoption grew but thinned out.** Weekly active teams rose 40% (1,240 \u2192 1,733), while seat utilisation inside those teams fell from 71% to 64%.\n\n4. **Support held its SLA under higher load.** Ticket volume up 18% to 2,904, yet median first response was 3.1 hours against a 4-hour commitment.\n\n5. **Two risks carry into Q4.** The egress overage is expected to persist without a caching change, and the utilisation drop alongside team growth points to shallow adoption.\n</message>"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 425, "cache_read_input_tokens": 18328, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 425, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 0}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "5960790c-2b35-44ae-9916-785873c1b3d4", "uuid": "c8e6804d-c1e8-4649-8bf1-56ee535ab378", "timestamp": "2026-10-14T10:46:15.752Z", "request_id": "req_011Cg1zg3KU4PUqLMBpqGhTx"}
